{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earthlings is a charming side-scrolling strategy and resource management game set in a forgotten version of our distant past. Manage a small, precious team of workers as you gather resources, refine materials, defend against threats, and construct breathtaking monuments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Art for the Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the vibes and start creating. There are no strict rules. It\u2019s up to your imagination to bring your art to life. Explore the world to make sure you are never out of fresh ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/earthlings-build.gif?t=1749276744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a Thriving Settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage resources, grow your settlement, establish steady production, and make sure your Earthlings deliver the next masterpiece in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/earthlings-total.gif?t=1749276744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deal with the Unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt quickly as new challenges arise, from resource shortages to strange, supernatural events triggered by your anxious alien boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/earthlings-enemies-2.jpg?t=1749276744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Galactic Secret</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work for G, a washed-up alien who pretends to be an artist while you do the real work behind the scenes. As the story unfolds, you\u2019ll have the chance to either stick by him or outsmart him and reclaim control of your own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/secret.png?t=1749276744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Feel-Good Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With vibrant hand-drawn visuals and a playful cartoon style, Earthlings blends charm, chaos, and creativity into a cosmic adventure that\u2019s as lighthearted as it is full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508530?t=1749276744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749276744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/ef1e7de8b9901211c453010de4ec991c4d08cd1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749276744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/ef1e7de8b9901211c453010de4ec991c4d08cd1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749276744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earthlings is a charming side-scrolling strategy and resource management game set in a forgotten version of our distant past. Manage a small, precious team of workers as you gather resources, refine materials, defend against threats, and construct breathtaking monuments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Art for the Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the vibes and start creating. There are no strict rules. It\u2019s up to your imagination to bring your art to life. Explore the world to make sure you are never out of fresh ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/earthlings-build.gif?t=1749276744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a Thriving Settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage resources, grow your settlement, establish steady production, and make sure your Earthlings deliver the next masterpiece in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/earthlings-total.gif?t=1749276744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deal with the Unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt quickly as new challenges arise, from resource shortages to strange, supernatural events triggered by your anxious alien boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/earthlings-enemies-2.jpg?t=1749276744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Galactic Secret</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work for G, a washed-up alien who pretends to be an artist while you do the real work behind the scenes. As the story unfolds, you\u2019ll have the chance to either stick by him or outsmart him and reclaim control of your own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/secret.png?t=1749276744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Feel-Good Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With vibrant hand-drawn visuals and a playful cartoon style, Earthlings blends charm, chaos, and creativity into a cosmic adventure that\u2019s as lighthearted as it is full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Monoblok Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/4ac5376eeb778a1fed7b665f4b21f36db6b3d951/header.jpg?t=1749276744","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13.0<b